25-07:00","id":968667,"title":"","content":"It does, though it can be difficult to rely on as it's very much up to the ST if it will work in more than 2 forms with just the Rite of Dedication (which is needed if you want to take it with you into the Umbra and such). Fetish armor still counts as armor that can defend against silver though; and is probably a better choice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}